  Step 1: Collapse the config dimension (line 116-117)
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                   
  best_configs = np.argmin(compute_cost, axis=3)    # shape (K, K+1, M)
  best_compute_cost = np.amin(compute_cost, axis=3)  # shape (K, K+1, M)                                                                                                                                                                                                                           
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                   
  The cost table has shape (K, K+1, M, 1). The last dimension is the autosharding config index — in Phase 1 there is only 1 config, so this just squeezes it:                                                                                                                                      
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                   
  compute_cost[k, i, m, 0]  →  best_compute_cost[k, i, m]                                                                                                                                                                                                                                          
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                   
  best_configs[k, i, m] records which config was best (always 0 in Phase 1, used later to reconstruct the solution).                                                                                                                                                                               
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                   
