  This is the key insight from the Alpa paper. The pipeline total cost formula is:                                                                                                                                                                                                                 
   
  total_cost = sum_of_stage_costs + (B - 1) × max_stage_cost                                                                                                                                                                                                                                       
                       │                              │                                                                                                                                                                                                                                            
                first microbatch              bubble: B-1 idle microbatches                                                                                                                                                                                                                        
                flushes through              waiting for the slowest stage                                                                                                                                                                                                                         
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                   
  The slowest stage determines the bubble size. So alpa_dp tries every possible value of max_stage_cost as a threshold, calls alpa_dp_impl() to find the best partition under that threshold, and keeps the cheapest result.                                                                       
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                   
  Pruning (line 120): if max_stage_cost × B ≥ best_cost, even the bubble term alone exceeds the current best — skip this threshold entirely.                                                                                                                                                       
                  
  ---                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                              
  Step 3: alpa_dp_impl() — the actual DP (line 29)
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                   
  The DP tables (line 44-46)
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                   
  f          = np.full((num_layers+1, num_layers+1, num_devices+1), np.inf)
  f_stage_max = np.full((num_layers+1, num_layers+1, num_devices+1), 0.0)                                                                                                                                                                                                                          
  f_argmin   = np.full((num_layers+1, num_layers+1, num_devices+1, 3), -1)                                                                                                                                                                                                                         
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                   
  Three parallel tables:                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                           
                  
  ┌──────────────────────┬───────────────────────────────────────┬───────────────────────────────────┐                                                                                                                                                                                             
  │        Table         │                Stores                 │              Purpose              │
  ├──────────────────────┼───────────────────────────────────────┼───────────────────────────────────┤
  │ f[s, k, d]           │ minimum sum of stage costs            │ the DP objective                  │
  ├──────────────────────┼───────────────────────────────────────┼───────────────────────────────────┤
  │ f_stage_max[s, k, d] │ maximum stage cost in the best plan   │ needed for bubble formula         │                                                                                                                                                                                             
  ├──────────────────────┼───────────────────────────────────────┼───────────────────────────────────┤                                                                                                                                                                                             
  │ f_argmin[s, k, d]    │ (next_layer, submesh_idx, config_idx) │ traceback to reconstruct the plan │                                                                                                                                                                                             
  └──────────────────────┴───────────────────────────────────────┴───────────────────────────────────┘                                                                                                                                                                                             
                  
  Base case (line 47)                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                              
                  
  f[0, num_layers, 0] = 0

  Zero stages left, all K layers assigned, zero devices remaining → cost is 0. Every other f[0, *, *] stays inf (impossible state).                                                                                                                                                                
   
  Main DP loops (line 48-64)                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                       
                  
  for s in range(1, num_layers + 1):          # stages: 1 to K
      for k in range(num_layers-1, -1, -1):   # start layer: K-1 down to 0                                                                                                                                                                                                                         
          for d in range(1, num_devices + 1): # devices remaining: 1 to D                                                                                                                                                                                                                          
              for m, submesh in enumerate(submesh_choices):                                                                                                                                                                                                                                        
                  n_submesh_devices = int(np.prod(np.array(submesh)))                                                                                                                                                                                                                              
                  if n_submesh_devices <= d:                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                       
                      for i in range(num_layers, k, -1):   # end layer: K down to k+1
                          stage_cost = compute_cost[k, i, m]                                                                                                                                                                                                                                       
                          new_cost = f[s-1, i, d - n_submesh_devices] + stage_cost                                                                                                                                                                                                                 
                          if stage_cost <= max_stage_cost and new_cost < f[s, k, d]:                                                                                                                                                                                                               
                              f[s, k, d] = new_cost                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                
                              f_stage_max[s, k, d] = max(stage_cost,
                                  f_stage_max[s-1, i, d - n_submesh_devices])                                                                                                                                                                                                                      
                              f_argmin[s, k, d] = (i, m, best_configs[k, i, m])                                                                                                                                                                                                                    
   
  Reading the recurrence:                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                          
                  
  f[s, k, d] = best total cost when:                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                               
                 s stages still to assign
                 next unassigned layer = k                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                         
                 d devices still available
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                   
  Try every (end_layer i, submesh m):
    stage_cost = cost of layers[k:i] on submesh m                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                  
    if stage_cost ≤ max_stage_cost:          ← enforce the threshold                                                                                                                                                                                                                               
      new_cost = f[s-1, i, d-size(m)]        ← best cost of REMAINING s-1 stages                                                                                                                                                                                                                   
               + stage_cost                  ← cost of THIS stage                                                                                                                                                                                                                                  
      keep if new_cost < current best                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                              
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                   
  The stage_cost <= max_stage_cost check enforces that no single stage exceeds the current threshold being tested. This is how the outer loop and inner DP interact.                                                                                                                               
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                   
